  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Salient Crgt has obligated $71.8M in FY2027 to date across 8 awards, with an average award size of $9M. Obligations are down 94.7% year over year. Salient Crgt’s FY2027 obligations are concentrated: the Department of Homeland Security obligated $51.9M and the General Services Administration obligated $19.2M. Computer Systems Design Services accounts for $51.6M of FY2027 obligations, and Engineering Services accounts for $19.5M. Historical annual obligations show growth through FY26, rising from $405M in FY22 to $1.3B in FY26, then falling to $71.8M in FY27. The Pension Benefit Guaranty Corporation recorded $733K in FY2027 obligations. The Department of the Interior and the Department of Housing and Urban Development recorded $0 in FY2027 obligations. Administrative Management and General Management Consulting Services recorded $733K in FY2027 obligations, while Custom Computer Programming Services recorded $0.",
